  "details": "Option to block poorly optimized avatars are working greats. But there's something that I wish it have, ability to block all poor avatar except friends.\n\nWhen I'm in public instance with my friends, I find that I need to manually turn on each of my friend's avatar because they're in very poor ranking. I'll be nice to just block everyone that aren't my friends and have very poor avatar.\n\nThis is not the same as disable avatar for everyone but friend in Safety settings. Some of the people in the public instance are using good or better avatar performance. So I really wanted to see them all, not just a fallback robot avatar.",
